<section class="home-request" id="request" aria-labelledby="home-request-title">
    <div class="home-section-watermark" aria-hidden="true">Запрос</div>
    <div class="home-section-heading">
        <h2 id="home-request-title">Не нужно разбираться<br>в технологиях</h2>
        <div class="home-section-note">
            <img class="home-section-note__corners" src="/img/home-request-corners.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
            <p>Расскажите, какой результат нужен бизнесу.<br>Мы подберём формат продукта, команду<br>и понятный путь к запуску</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="home-request__cards">
        {{#each requestKinds}}
        <a class="home-request-card home-request-card--{{variant}}" href="#contact">
            <div class="home-request-card__art home-request-card__art--{{variant}}" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="home-request-card__crop">
                    <img src="/img/home-request-{{variant}}.png" width="1856" height="2304" alt="" loading="lazy">
                </div>
            </div>
            {{#if hasEdges}}
            <div class="home-request-card__edge home-request-card__edge--left" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/home-request-card-corners.svg" alt=""></div>
            <div class="home-request-card__edge home-request-card__edge--right" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/img/home-request-card-corners.svg" alt=""></div>
            {{/if}}
            <div class="home-request-card__copy">
                <h3>{{title}}</h3>
                <p>{{description}}</p>
            </div>
        </a>
        {{/each}}
    </div>
</section>
